01:02:34.550 --> 01:02:37.310
And yeah, we have a few
exciting new programs also

01:02:37.310 --> 01:02:40.190
in development at Stellenbosch
in machine learning

01:02:40.190 --> 01:02:41.886
and artificial intelligence.

01:02:41.886 --> 01:02:43.010
MELANIE WARRICK: Thank you.

01:02:43.010 --> 01:02:44.270
